  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: DragonHierarch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Dragon Hierarch
  role: 1
  description: 'A Dragon of the Empire''s ruling caste, escorted by two Dragonborn
    Honorguard. The Hierarch is a huge winged dragon (15 health, Armor Level 2) that
    moves 30 m (60 m sprinting) and fights with its Dragon Claw (5 damage, penetration
    1, 2 m), so it must get right up to the enemy to strike. Its Honorguard are elite
    Dragonborn (10 health, Armor Level 2, 95% accuracy) with Dragon Glaives: a rifle
    out to 20 m, and a blade (5 damage, penetration 2, +25% accuracy) when an enemy
    is within 2 m. However far the dragon moves, the Honorguard follow it, ending
    within 5 m. A Commander: every army needs exactly one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5061a10a406acf44928a759878631b6, type: 2}
